WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:02.710
SPEAKER: Meet Cloud
Functions, a faster way

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:04.420
to build in the cloud.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.000
You focus on writing your
code, and Cloud Functions

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.390
makes sure your application runs
resiliently, cost effectively,

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:12.460
and at planet-scale,
allowing you to move

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.620
faster than ever before.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.160
Events are happening all
the time in your system,

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.450
like file uploads
to Cloud Storage,

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:23.440
changes to database records,
requests to HTTP endpoints,

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.430
and more.

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.950
You write code that runs in
response to those events,

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:29.830
and Cloud Functions runs it
and automatically manages

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:32.479
underlying
infrastructure for you.

00:00:32.479 --> 00:00:35.140
And you only pay while
your code is running.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.640
Whether you're
building applications

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.300
for the enterprise, e-commerce,
consumers, or anyone else,

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.460
the Cloud Functions
makes it easy.

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:45.100
It connects and extends your
cloud services with code

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.240
so that you can treat
them as building blocks,

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.380
move fast, and adjust
as your needs change.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.320
With Cloud Functions, you can
apply artificial intelligence

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.510
when new data shows
up in your system.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.100
It only takes a
few lines of code

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:00.970
to understand what's inside
your images, video, or text.

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:03.580
Bring IoT device data
into your application

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.890
and analyze it as it arrives.

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:07.960
Use big data
analytics and machine

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.610
learning in your
Google Assistant app

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.810
to build engaging conversational
experiences for your users.

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:16.750
Or extend your application
using the broad ecosystem

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.690
of third-party
services and APIs.

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:21.940
No matter what you're
building, with Cloud Functions,

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:25.060
you can innovate faster,
focus on what really matters,

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:27.760
and build great
applications for your users.

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.220
The possibilities are
endless with code.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:34.650
Visit cloud.google.com/functions
and go build something amazing

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:36.080
today.

